 "lede": "The agent splits the program among specialists who each own their files, and keeps processor time and final assembly to itself. One specialist captures what a model does internally across a large prompt set. Another tests ways to compress what the model holds in memory and measures what each costs in accuracy. Results are stored by version, and when storage reports a fault, lost items go back for reprocessing.",
